        "semantic_kind": "対象",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 302",
        "original_text": "Runner状態、Retryable Job、Clock、Catch-up、外部呼出しとLocal Commitの境界。"
      },
      {
        "coverage_id": "SDD-L0325",
        "semantic_kind": "対象",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 325",
        "original_text": "外部Data / Model APIを利用してCanonical Stateへ結果を反映するRetryable Job。"
      },
      {
